Deselect as Fajr Adhan\",\"Device sounds\":\"Device sounds\",\"Disabled\":\"Disabled\",\"Disclaimer\":\"Disclaimer\",\"Dismiss\":\"Dismiss\",\"Diyanet method provided in Al-Azan is an approximation of the official times. Since there's not enough documentation available on how the times are exactly calculated, times may not align with the official website, especially out of Turkey.\":\"Diyanet method provided in Al-Azan is an approximation of the official times. Since there's not enough documentation available on how the times are exactly calculated, times may not align with the official website, especially out of Turkey.\",\"Diyanet \u0130\u015fleri Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131, Turkey\":\"Diyanet \u0130\u015fleri Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131, Turkey\",\"Doesn't use any kind of trackers\":\"Doesn't use any kind of trackers\",\"Don't ask again\":\"Don't ask again\",\"Don't show again\":\"Don't show again\",\"Don't show alarm screen?\":\"Don't show alarm screen?\",\"Done\":\"Done\",\"Download\":\"Download\",\"Eastern Arabic\":\"Eastern Arabic\",\"Edit\":\"Edit\",\"Edit Calculation Parameters\":\"Edit Calculation Parameters\",\"Edit Counter\":\"Edit Counter\",\"Edit Location\":\"Edit Location\",\"Edit Reminder\":\"Edit Reminder\",\"Edit Silent Mode\":\"Edit Silent Mode\",\"Egyptian General Survey Authority\":\"Egyptian General Survey Authority\",\"Enabled\":\"Enabled\",\"End after prayer (minutes)\":\"End after prayer (minutes)\",\"Error getting clipboard data\":\"Error getting clipboard data\",\"Error in loading countries\":\"Error in loading countries\",\"Error while downloading audio\":\"Error while downloading audio\",\"Error while getting coordinates\":\"Error while getting coordinates\",\"Error: failed to open file\":\"Error: failed to open file\",\"Ethiopic\":\"Ethiopic\",\"Export app data\":\"Export app data\",\"Export data\":\"Export data\",\"Fajr Angle\":\"Fajr Angle\",\"Find My Location\":\"Find My Location\",\"Fix Common Problems\":\"Fix Common Problems\",\"France angle 15\":\"France angle 15\",\"France angle 18\":\"France angle 18\",\"Friday\":\"Friday\",\"General (default)\":\"General (default)\",\"Getting coordinates\":\"Getting coordinates\",\"Got it\":\"Got it\",\"Gregorian\":\"Gregorian\",\"Gulf region\":\"Gulf region\",\"Hanafi\":\"Hanafi\",\"Hidden?\":\"Hidden?\",\"Hide Prayer Times\":\"Hide Prayer Times\",\"Hide times you don't need\":\"Hide times you don't need\",\"High\":\"High\",\"High Latitude\":\"High Latitude\",\"Highlight current prayer\":\"Highlight current prayer\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"Homescreen and notification Widgets\":\"Homescreen and notification Widgets\",\"However, When using online services, such as Qibla map, app may transmit minimum necessary data that may or may not uniquely identify you. Please keep this in mind while using the app.\":\"However, When using online services, such as Qibla map, app may transmit minimum necessary data that may or may not uniquely identify you. Please keep this in mind while using the app.\",\"I Understand\":\"I Understand\",\"IMPORTANT_CHANNEL_ID\":\"Important\",\"If enabled, when a notification is shown, it will contain info for the next prayer time\":\"If enabled, when a notification is shown, it will contain info for the next prayer time\",\"If you have activated \u201cBackup & Reset\u201d in your phone settings (Settings / Backup & Reset / Back up my data), you should be aware that Android itself (not Al-Azan) will periodically save a copy of your phone\u2019s data in Google\u2019s servers. This allows Android to recover your data in case your device gets damaged, or you purchase a new device. The developers of Al-Azan do not have access to this data.\":\"If you have activated \u201cBackup & Reset\u201d in your phone settings (Settings / Backup & Reset / Back up my data), you should be aware that Android itself (not Al-Azan) will periodically save a copy of your phone\u2019s data in Google\u2019s servers. This allows Android to recover your data in case your device gets damaged, or you purchase a new device. The developers of Al-Azan do not have access to this data.\",\"If you still had problem with app stopping after some time, please visit dontkillmyapp.com for more solutions.\":\"If you still had problem with app stopping after some time, please visit dontkillmyapp.com for more solutions.\",\"If you want to make sure the app can work reliably, You have to disable power optimization for this app. You can open related settings using the button below.\":\"If you want to make sure the app can work reliably, You have to disable power optimization for this app. You can open related settings using the button below.\",\"If your device has adaptive charging, like Google Pixel, and you don't want adhan or reminders to be recognized as an alarm, you can enable this option.\":\"If your device has adaptive charging, like Google Pixel, and you don't want adhan or reminders to be recognized as an alarm, you can enable this option.\",\"Import\":\"Import\",\"Import app data\":\"Import app data\",\"Import successful\":\"Import successful\",\"In addition to five daily prayers, it has settings for Sunrise, Sunset, Midnight and Night Prayer (Tahajjud)\":\"In addition to five daily prayers, it has settings for Sunrise, Sunset, Midnight and Night Prayer (Tahajjud)\",\"Increment\":\"Increment\",\"Info\":\"Info\",\"Internet connection\":\"Internet connection\",\"Internet connection is necessary for qibla map to work. Please enable your wifi or mobile data and try again.\":\"Internet connection is necessary for qibla map to work. Please enable your wifi or mobile data and try again.\",\"Iran\":\"Iran\",\"Is localized in English, Persian, Arabic, Turkish, Indonesian, French, Urdu, Hindi, German, Bosnian, Vietnamese, Bangla\":\"Is localized in English, Persian, Arabic, Turkish, Indonesian, French, Urdu, Hindi, German, Bosnian, Vietnamese, Bangla\",\"Isha Angle\":\"Isha Angle\",\"Isha Interval\":\"Isha Interval\",\"Islamic\":\"Islamic\",