\nto prevent the app from getting killed in the background.\\nIn that case disable any power saving option for the app.\",\"Sound\":\"Sound\",\"Spiritual Administration of Muslims of Russia\":\"Spiritual Administration of Muslims of Russia\",\"Start before prayer (minutes)\":\"Start before prayer (minutes)\",\"Status\":\"Status\",\"Stop\":\"Stop\",\"Sunday\":\"Sunday\",\"Sunset to Fajr (Default)\":\"Sunset to Fajr (Default)\",\"Sunset to Sunrise\":\"Sunset to Sunrise\",\"System Default\":\"System Default\",\"Tahajjud time mentioned in the app is the last third of the night\":\"Tahajjud time mentioned in the app is the last third of the night\",\"Thai Solar\":\"Thai Solar\",\"Thanks for choosing this app! There are things you need to do before you can start using this app.\":\"Thanks for choosing this app! There are things you need to do before you can start using this app.\",\"The Gulf Region (Dubai)\":\"The Gulf Region (Dubai)\",\"The app's lunar calendar is pre-calculated and may not be accurate because it isn't based on moon sightings. This is especially important to note for the start and end of Ramadan.\":\"The app's lunar calendar is pre-calculated and may not be accurate because it isn't based on moon sightings. This is especially important to note for the start and end of Ramadan.\",\"The text found in this website and in the app may not be accurate in other languages, so in any case, only English version should be considered.\":\"The text found in this website and in the app may not be accurate in other languages, so in any case, only English version should be considered.\",\"The type of calendar that is shown on top of home screen and beside lunar calendar in widgets\":\"The type of calendar that is shown on top of home screen and beside lunar calendar in widgets\",\"The type of lunar calendar shown in main screen and widgets\":\"The type of lunar calendar shown in main screen and widgets\",\"Theme Color\":\"Theme Color\",\"Thursday\":\"Thursday\",\"Time\":\"Time\",\"Time condition\":\"Time condition\",\"Time format\":\"Time format\",\"Time list\":\"Time list\",\"To calculate Adhan, We need your location. You can use the \\\"Find My Location\\\" button, or use the country and city/area search, or enter your coordinates manually.\":\"To calculate Adhan, We need your location. You can use the \\\"Find My Location\\\" button, or use the country and city/area search, or enter your coordinates manually.\",\"To see notifications about adhan, we need your permission.\":\"To see notifications about adhan, we need your permission.\",\"To stop playing adhan when you receive a call, we need to read your phone state. not allowing this permission simply disables the feature.\":\"To stop playing adhan when you receive a call, we need to read your phone state. not allowing this permission simply disables the feature.\",\"Tomorrow\":\"Tomorrow\",\"Tuesday\":\"Tuesday\",\"Turn Left\":\"Turn Left\",\"Turn Right\":\"Turn Right\",\"Turn history off\":\"Turn history off\",\"Turn history on\":\"Turn history on\",\"Twilight Angle\":\"Twilight Angle\",\"Umm al-Qura University, Makkah\":\"Umm al-Qura University, Makkah\",\"Union Organization Islamic de France\":\"Union Organization Islamic de France\",\"University of Islamic Sciences, Karachi\":\"University of Islamic Sciences, Karachi\",\"Unknown Error\":\"Unknown Error\",\"Unreliable\":\"Unreliable\",\"Unresolved (default)\":\"Unresolved (default)\",\"Unsupported\":\"Unsupported\",\"Up\":\"Up\",\"Upcoming alarm\":\"Upcoming alarm\",\"Updating widgets\":\"Updating widgets\",\"Use 24-Hour format\":\"Use 24-Hour format\",\"Use Compass\":\"Use Compass\",\"Use Map\":\"Use Map\",\"Use a different alarm type?\":\"Use a different alarm type?\",\"Use adaptive theme?\":\"Use adaptive theme?\",\"Use headphones when available?\":\"Use headphones when available?\",\"Using Coordinates\":\"Using Coordinates\",\"Using GPS\":\"Using GPS\",\"Using Search\":\"Using Search\",\"Version\":\"Version\",\"Vibratio